This README file contains a brief description of the verification case.

A simple test for a 1-d case with only 100 elements. To test the correctness of the implantation of
E, k, Cp,alpha model. The temperature rise from 673.15 at the left side to 1673.15 K at the right side.

The comparison results can be found in file verification.ods.
